{"id":"n89595-2-17","stage":0,"title":"십 · 十","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89595-2-17-1","ko":"마감이 언제까지인가요?","zh":"截止到什么时候？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"마감이","meaning":"截至，截止日期","explanation":"마감：截至，截止日期；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"마감","audio":"/audio/b3c3a4498c73ca41c8bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51504","senseId":"2","lemma":"마감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마감이","audio":"/audio/fe65252b5d64501e6986.mp3"}},{"text":"언제까지인가요?","meaning":"截止到什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候；-까지 表示“到……为止”；인가요 是礼貌疑问形式。整句询问截止时间。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제까지인가요","audio":"/audio/6a7b7037e8f6e6b2983b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b3c3a4498c73ca41","term":"마감","zh":"截至，截止日期","audio":"/audio/b3c3a4498c73ca41c8bb.mp3","entryId":"51504","definition":"规定完成某事的最终期限。","pronunciation":["마감"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"什么时候","pronunciation":["언ː제"]}],"audio":"/audio/0a486b879c71a93f7e2c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89595-2-17-2","ko":"시작일로부터 십 일까지입니다.","zh":"从开始日期起，期限是十天。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시작일로부터","meaning":"从开始日期起","explanation":"시작일：开始日期；-로부터：从……起。整段表示“从开始日期起”。","readings":[{"term":"시작","audio":"/audio/b1f28cd21af730b22ed3.mp3"},{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36687","senseId":"1","lemma":"시작","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62598","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시작일로부터","audio":"/audio/4cca0c0cf75716d44272.mp3"}},{"text":"십","meaning":"十","explanation":"십：十；这里修饰 일，组成“十天”，不是“第十”。","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"ent